controls.description:
Mechanisms exist to inventory, uniquely identify and assign accountable ownership for Control Assurance Automation (CAA) automated identifies, including:
(1) Service accounts;
(2) API keys;
(3) OAuth grants; and
(4) Machine and workload identities.

